-09-04T19:48:03Z\",\"tracker\":\"powder\"}`\n- `/home/phaedrus/development/misty-step/canopy/forest publish review-request builder <branch> <file>`: exit 0, published review-request\n- `gh pr create --head <branch>`: https://github.com/misty-step/canopy/pull/14 (names Powder job, no invented Closes)\n\nRisks/unverified: 1s slack is a chosen small allowance for timer/render drift; worst-case SSH collection beyond 30s still expires (by design, silent expiry preserved). No credential exposure, no master modification, no raw push.\n"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"meta/muse-spark-1.3-contributor","usage":{"input":8812,"output":793,"cacheRead":47985,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":27,"totalTokens":57590,"cost":{"input":0.0083714,"output":0.003172,"cacheRead":0.007677600000000001,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.019221}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1788551296672,"responseId":"gen-1788551296-J0eH4vwIaqmXApDdUTHh","rawStopReason":"stop"},"toolResults":[]}
