cation is not a summary. It must test a claim that can be false.\n\n1. State the condition and expected result.\n2. Select the smallest surface that can disprove the claim.\n3. Capture the old result when the claim needs a before-and-after comparison.\n4. Capture the new result with the same input and environment.\n5. Compare the direct evidence. Use output, responses, measurements, or visible behavior.\n6. Report `VERIFIED`, `NOT VERIFIED`, or `INCONCLUSIVE`.\n\nName the command or scenario. Show the important result. State any limit or confounding condition. Do not turn a passing build into proof of user behavior.\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1788551274154},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"[{\"type\":\"reasoning.encrypted\",\"data\":\"Q-PaDgHrEqIl0T71VHOFFPwgbs13czRmdrgGpuUzPN1PFUKlDjwiufgvaPj42GC7aPvLNbe15eKD8zaIftFIFuZRuBOEcotX1q22i4bV9BC-BAa7X0wOzW7Rsltt6POB91rES7WOxpJKvlYQqP9gHFPquoDEGGYGRYqndAm8kE0midj92ybhGIPwpaea9Smw6m-IUbdx91nFvc2MARF_YkBrwkHJM38FMX0hYSqYBtoA8egxXIRzmpeU470wprrqG55iYTnHKsty8hyogp3bGMD3LkeAvtPHKRW7ljjmgrjKUaP1fuX3NIryjyEI-3VWu0jiPdRPFAZ8Fy3sefxTvIcVlY951N2oshPTR3VqZHQ-5KAaMxOg6Y7q6C-kZNLzvLbgpxho9hcrts_oIE3fUUdcUTv1FmFCIwZPVu0gpLJeWv6SjF7I1isIs7rwUlu3tPqYbgl5qVpNXyfXXX76j4GOJyiTTi0eaI2Wit55p1CbUoqTj6m1xCgyVQ_nWgg5HqvgPllB9RC7hk-8SgU-F_1aTAi1ItP7AX6jK_K6uZvaxeIfFh9hf8k1ICXpTP-EhNVhp7M6dkP1rTbbsfds10riRGh4jQM_t-NUA2Ju66ScvYQic5mOi9HEn4e93ZgGLq7X0-HsSzXbAGDUVyKmUhi1ILkzTXaeMnbgkbCcVi28yTVOzu0a5ONboTEvoQWodVu8ExhTTtlHmRXs5wu1wss3W9vQrQoJOXUcefr44kI3b2qlwwOHgA2apAbzh68IuKj9q_oeVxoyceShJ9fcjtlyfjHd3VmJKN5ic5x2ivk2SysU9hZsJ9mh6TOA9uQKulKnbKZSSKHiU9ThdBeNhHPbIfgrzUmS9xXyoRWgHZv5FQPeyDaRviP8OzcGzq3KsGg78JVAs5fddbnLZStC8Awh4wOO6b70ZaFp-OL-A-wsE2LtXXUB8H20hEBDrZhu5_-NcAKJk0bTMxXtn9oSEfi8p-pLtrPBCI4OGhOlQ5CzKQ2wKkh2YKKnAFyrGT2zn_TqqXKbmxP94n2cs2eh3jAIGEl6UTWGPcM_AtOh8yfbIePA5IpxLmFwwdYOxL4fn3eQIBIrDTy6CU8FgKkPnZJRUjzaG3g6pO7gZjnNtoS0kwDwQU5fDcCv0ZE6Z5t8N_Bgwh9QxrKz6yHIUxzgChrRFNtsmALXz8fmgMbMVNo9I